WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.461
[music]

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:06.965
<i>It's a lot of nerves,
but I'm really excited.</i>

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:09.134
<i>After three years
of having been here and</i>

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.927 align:start position:0% line:76%
going through nursing school,
especially through

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.554 align:start position:0% line:76%
the pandemic,
has been a difficult time.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.557 align:start position:0% line:76%
But after all our hard work,
I'm excited to see where

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:17.559 align:start position:0% line:76%
we're all going to be going over
the next couple of years.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.106 align:start size:63% position:38% line:78%
Incredibly exciting.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:25.483 line:76%
Just seeing everyone out here,
being dressed in these gowns

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:28.111 align:end position:100% line:76%
feels like all the hard
work was worth it.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.448
<i>I don't really know
how to express, like,</i>

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.782
<i>all the emotion I'm feeling like</i>

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:35.076 line:76%
everything I've been through
in the last four years at Yale,

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.455 align:start position:0% line:76%
how hard the last two years were
and finally be here

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:42.542 align:start position:0% line:76%
I feel just sort of overcome
with just emotions,

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.960 align:start position:0% line:78%
really happy.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.297
<i>[band playing "Boola Boola"]</i>

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:57.015
[cheering]

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:04.272
[cheers and applause]

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:17.410
<i>I now ask you,
by your official act,</i>

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:20.830 align:end position:100%
to confirm upon them,
these degrees.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:24.167
[crowd cheering]

